Accordingly, the learned Judicial Magistrate No.II, Coimbatore is directed to return the above articles to the petitioner on the following conditions:
(i)The petitioner shall execute a personal bond for sum of Rs.2,00,000/- (Rupees Two Lakh only) with two solvency surety, for a like sum to the satisfaction of the learned Judicial Magistrate No.II, Coimbatore;
(ii)The petitioner shall not alter, alienate or encumber the car viz., Toyato Corolla Altis car bearing Reg.No.TN-37-DA-9889 and two wheelers viz., Yamaha Ray Blue Colour bearing Reg.No.TN-37-CK-6888 and Honda Activa Two Wheeler bearing Purusothaman vs The State Rep.

