2 Reg.No.TN-37-DP-1888 in any manner;
(iii)The petitioner shall produce the original RC Books along with self attested photostat copies of RC Books of the car and two wheelers and other https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis relevant records to prove his ownership.

The learned Judicial Magistrate No.II, Coimbatore, shall peruse the RC books and other records, retain xerox copy of the same and return the original RC books to the petitioner;
(iv)The petitioner shall not misuse the mobile phones viz., Promax Model Apple Cellphone and Samsung Galaxy M21 Model Cellphone for commission of any offence in future;
(v)The petitioner shall also given an undertaking that he will produce the above said car, two wheelers and mobile phones as and when required by the respondent Police and by the Court below.
7.In the result, this criminal revision case stands allowed.
12.11.2024

